@startuml
title Detection details - lookup by UUID
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

actor Client
boundary "Get detection controller" as API
control GetDetectionHandler as Handler
database TimescaleDB as DB

Client -> API : GET /api/v1/detections/{id}
API -> API : Validate UUID
note over API,Handler : Controller creates handler with request-scoped AsyncSession
API -> Handler : handle(GetDetectionQuery(id))
Handler -> DB : SELECT detection by primary key\nAsyncSession.get(Detection, id)
alt Detection exists
    DB --> Handler : Detection
    Handler -> Handler : Validate GetDetectionResponse
    Handler --> API : GetDetectionResponse
    API --> Client : 200 + detection details
else Detection does not exist
    DB --> Handler : None
    Handler --> API : DetectionNotFoundError
    API --> Client : 404 {detail: "Detection not found"}
end
note over Client,API : Invalid UUID: 422 before handler dispatch\nUnavailable database: 503 via shared exception handler
@enduml
